  description: '2 Level 7 monsters

    Once per turn: You can send 1 Plant-Type
    monster from your hand or face-up from your side of the field to the Graveyard;
    look at a number of cards from the top of your Deck equal to the Level that the
    sent monster had in the hand or on the field, then place them on the top of the
    Deck in any order. Once per turn: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card;
    choose a number from 1 to 3, then excavate that many cards from the top of your
    Deck, send any excavated Plant-Type monsters to the Graveyard, and if you do,
    return up to that many cards on the field to the hand (min.1), except this card.
    Also, place the other cards on the bottom of your Deck in any order.'
